# Search Insert Position

題目:
給定一組陣列和一個目標數字，找出該目標位於此陣列的哪個索引(index)，如果沒有，則找出應該放在此陣列的哪個索引。

程式碼:
#include <stdio.h>

int searchInsert(int* nums, int numsSize, int target) {
    int left = 0;
    int right = numsSize - 1;

    while (left <= right) {
        int mid = (left + right) / 2;

        if (nums[mid] == target) {
            return mid;
        } else if (nums[mid] < target) {
            left = mid + 1;
        } else {
            right = mid - 1;
        }
    }
    return left;
}

int main() {
    int nums[] = {1, 3, 5, 6};
    int numsSize = 4;
    int target = 5;

    int k = searchInsert(nums, numsSize, target);
    printf("k = %d\n", k);

    return 0;
}

